utes at a true 1:1 scale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large, detailed map of Berlin with more than 200 stops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berlin bus lines TXL, 100, N100, 123, 142, 147, 200, 245, and 300 with different routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many varied and interesting Berlin landmarks to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially licensed buses from Scania, MAN, and VDL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different bus types with a total of 20 variants: MAN Lion\u2019s City DD, Scania Citywide LF solo and articulated, VDL Citea LLE, MB eCitybus solo and articulated, Galaxis Urban solo and articulated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially licensed onboard computer from ATRON</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated radio stations: Flashbass.FM and DoubleBass.FM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer Freeplay mode: Transport passengers with the vehicle of your choice on any line and route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer Economy mode: Build your own bus company, invest in new vehicles, hire staff, take care of maintenance and repairs, and increase your income through contracts and ticket sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Team up with others, drive through Berlin together, and experience the city as a group, whether on a line or on a discovery tour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom of movement: Move freely inside vehicles and throughout the game world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game events: Random events make the game world feel more alive and varied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boarding and alighting passengers including ticket sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI traffic with different vehicle types, pedestrians, and complex traffic light logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night cycle with weather and seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and time synchronization: Dynamically match weather and time of day to the current values in Berlin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line, route, timetable, and tour editors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop content: Expand your experience with Workshop content you can download directly via Steam, such as community made maps or repaints, as well as other content that extends the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding features: Create your own Workshop content, either just for yourself or to share with others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode for creating your own high quality screenshots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple control modes: Realistic, Arcade, and Custom</p></li></ul>","developers":["TML-Studios"],"dlc":[3544250],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper<br>5 Activations per 24 hours machine activation limit","genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/491540/82270ee93148b8dce9104055e83bbe0256126d4d/header.jpg?t=1774530139","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2021 AEROSOFT. All rights reserved. All trademarks and brand names are trademarks or registered trademarks of the respective owners. Copyrights are serious stuff. If you find any pirated copies of this software please notify us at support@aerosoft.com. We will make sure reports of copyrights violation are rewarded. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAerosoft GmbH<br />\r\nLindberghring 12<br />\r\nD-33142 B\u00fcren, Germany","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/491540/87983395/a9e89c0e3c46eca224f3755997e0d02de1687592/17